  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participation of &#x20ac;20 million in the 7-year tranche of Schuldschein issuance by  Hornbach Holding AG &amp;amp;amp; Co. KGaA.  The proceeds of the Bank&apos;s financing will be used to support the Borrower&apos;s  2026-2028 capex investments in Serbia via its local subsidiary. These includes  capex related to the construction of retail stores, eligible under the Bank&apos;s  Green Economy Transition (GET) approach.</narrative>
